    "updated_at": "2022-10-19T12:09:57Z",
    "body": "Well yes, but it's mixed into `Element`, which `HTMLAnchorElement` for instance inherits from. In WebKit `HTMLAnchorElement.prototype[Symbol.unscopables` returns an object with eight properties set to true. Which I guess hints at @domenic's first solution.\r\n\r\ncc @shvaikalesh ",
