    "created_at": "2022-10-19T12:50:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-19T12:50:45Z",
    "body": "I don't think we have a lot of other things to base this choice on. I personally find the second solution slightly more logical, since it somewhat follows the interface prototype chain, but I guess the first solution is a bit more dictionary-like. I can't say I feel strongly either way.",
